Wizards are, IMHO, by far the easiest characters to play.  If you play
them right, they're almost impossible to kill--starvation and suchlike
will be your greatest enemy until a very high level.  I've only played
them twice seriously (I'm on my second one now), but the first one was
my first character to even make it to the castle--he cleared out
Gehennom, found the vibrating square, and was finally cilled off by
the WoY.  Top score in my file;  3 times #2.

-Avrom, who discovered a very nice trick the other day, involving the
